<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>	
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2010/07/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>crashplan</id>
    <title>CrashPlan</title>
    <version>{{PackageVersion}}</version>
    <authors>Code 42 Software</authors>
    <owners>Kristinn-Stefansson</owners>
    <summary>**DEPRECATED** - CrashPlan consumer service has been discontinued. This package is no longer maintained.</summary>
    <description>
**DEPRECATED PACKAGE - DO NOT INSTALL**

This package is deprecated as CrashPlan for Home (consumer) service has been discontinued by Code42. The consumer version of CrashPlan is no longer available for download or use.

**Alternative backup solutions:**
- Windows Backup and Restore
- File History (Windows 10/11)
- OneDrive
- Google Drive
- Dropbox
- Backblaze Personal Backup
- Carbonite

If you have CrashPlan installed, please consider migrating to one of the alternative backup solutions listed above.

This package will display a deprecation warning and will not install CrashPlan.</description>
    <projectUrl>http://www.crashplan.com/consumer/crashplan.html</projectUrl>
    <tags>Backup CrashPlan admin deprecated discontinued</tags>
